            "Swarming also has a place in the [Theory of Constraints](/project-management/kanban/theory-of-constraints/): when one stage is the bottleneck, people from other stages swarm on it to exploit the constraint before anyone argues for more capacity. Track the effect through [cycle time](/project-management/kanban/cycle-time/) and [throughput](/project-management/kanban/throughput/), not through how busy people look.",
